# Data Models & Schemas

This file contains detailed MongoDB schemas for all 11 modules of EcoDrug.

## Module 1 & 2: User and Profile

### User Model
```javascript
{
  email: String (required, unique, lowercase),
  username: String (required, unique, 3+ chars),
  password: String (required, hashed with bcrypt, 6+ chars),
  role: String (enum: ['user', 'organization', 'moderator', 'admin']),
  profile: ObjectId (ref: Profile),
  isVerified: Boolean (default: false),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### Profile Model
```javascript
{
  user: ObjectId (ref: User, required, unique),
  fullName: String,
  avatar: String (URL or path),
  bio: String (max 500 chars),
  location: {
    city: String,
    country: String,
    coordinates: [Number] // [longitude, latitude]
  },
  points: Number (default: 0, min: 0),
  level: Number (default: 1, min: 1),
  achievements: [ObjectId] (ref: Achievement),
  completedCourses: [ObjectId] (ref: Course),
  attendedEvents: [ObjectId] (ref: Event),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 3: Education

### Course Model
```javascript
{
  title: String (required, max 200 chars),
  description: String (required, max 1000 chars),
  content: String (rich text / markdown),
  category: String (enum: ['recycling', 'energy', 'water', 'biodiversity', 'climate', 'general']),
  level: String (enum: ['beginner', 'intermediate', 'advanced']),
  duration: Number (minutes),
  points: Number (reward for completion),
  thumbnail: String (image URL),
  author: ObjectId (ref: User),
  modules: [{
    title: String,
    content: String,
    order: Number,
    videoUrl: String,
    resources: [String] // URLs to additional materials
  }],
  quiz: ObjectId (ref: Quiz),
  published: Boolean (default: false),
  enrolledCount: Number (default: 0),
  rating: Number (default: 0, min: 0, max: 5),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### Quiz Model
```javascript
{
  course: ObjectId (ref: Course, required),
  questions: [{
    question: String (required),
    type: String (enum: ['multiple_choice', 'true_false', 'text']),
    options: [String], // for multiple choice
    correctAnswer: String or Number (index),
    explanation: String,
    points: Number (default: 10)
  }],
  passingScore: Number (percentage, default: 70),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 4: News

### News Model
```javascript
{
  title: String (required, max 200 chars),
  content: String (required, rich text),
  excerpt: String (max 300 chars),
  thumbnail: String (image URL),
  category: String (enum: ['news', 'article', 'guide', 'event_report', 'research']),
  tags: [String],
  author: ObjectId (ref: User, required),
  status: String (enum: ['draft', 'pending', 'approved', 'rejected'], default: 'pending'),
  moderator: ObjectId (ref: User), // who approved/rejected
  moderationNote: String,
  publishedAt: Date,
  views: Number (default: 0),
  likes: [ObjectId] (refs: User),
  comments: [{
    user: ObjectId (ref: User),
    text: String,
    createdAt: Date
  }],
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 5: Events

### Event Model
```javascript
{
  title: String (required, max 200 chars),
  description: String (required, max 1000 chars),
  type: String (enum: ['cleanup', 'workshop', 'conference', 'webinar', 'tree_planting', 'other']),
  organizer: ObjectId (ref: User, required), // organization or user
  date: Date (required),
  endDate: Date,
  location: {
    address: String,
    city: String,
    country: String,
    coordinates: [Number] // [longitude, latitude]
  },
  isOnline: Boolean (default: false),
  onlineLink: String (if isOnline),
  capacity: Number (max participants),
  registered: [ObjectId] (refs: User),
  attendees: [ObjectId] (refs: User), // who actually attended
  thumbnail: String (image URL),
  tags: [String],
  status: String (enum: ['draft', 'pending', 'approved', 'cancelled'], default: 'pending'),
  points: Number (reward for participation),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 6: Map

### RecyclingPoint Model
```javascript
{
  name: String (required),
  type: [String] (enum: ['plastic', 'glass', 'paper', 'metal', 'electronics', 'batteries', 'clothes', 'hazardous', 'organic']),
  address: String (required),
  city: String (required),
  country: String (default: 'Russia'),
  coordinates: {
    type: String (default: 'Point'),
    coordinates: [Number] // [longitude, latitude]
  },
  workingHours: String,
  phone: String,
  website: String,
  description: String,
  photos: [String] (image URLs),
  addedBy: ObjectId (ref: User),
  verified: Boolean (default: false),
  rating: Number (default: 0),
  reviews: [{
    user: ObjectId (ref: User),
    rating: Number (1-5),
    comment: String,
    createdAt: Date
  }],
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 7: Gamification

### Achievement Model
```javascript
{
  name: String (required),
  description: String (required),
  icon: String (image URL or emoji),
  type: String (enum: ['course', 'event', 'news', 'points', 'streak', 'special']),
  condition: {
    type: String (e.g., 'complete_courses', 'earn_points', 'attend_events'),
    value: Number (threshold)
  },
  points: Number (bonus points),
  rarity: String (enum: ['common', 'rare', 'epic', 'legendary']),
  createdAt: Date
}
```

### Challenge Model
```javascript
{
  title: String (required),
  description: String (required),
  type: String (enum: ['daily', 'weekly', 'monthly', 'special']),
  startDate: Date (required),
  endDate: Date (required),
  goal: {
    type: String (e.g., 'complete_courses', 'attend_events', 'earn_points'),
    target: Number
  },
  reward: {
    points: Number,
    achievement: ObjectId (ref: Achievement)
  },
  participants: [{
    user: ObjectId (ref: User),
    progress: Number (default: 0),
    completed: Boolean (default: false)
  }],
  active: Boolean (default: true),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 8: Notifications

### Notification Model
```javascript
{
  user: ObjectId (ref: User, required),
  type: String (enum: ['event', 'challenge', 'achievement', 'news', 'system', 'moderation']),
  title: String (required),
  message: String (required),
  link: String (optional link to related content),
  relatedModel: String (e.g., 'Event', 'Course'),
  relatedId: ObjectId,
  read: Boolean (default: false),
  createdAt: Date
}
```

## Module 9: Support (Donations)

### Donation Model
```javascript
{
  user: ObjectId (ref: User),
  amount: Number (required, min: 1),
  currency: String (default: 'RUB'),
  paymentMethod: String (enum: ['card', 'paypal', 'yandex_money', 'other']),
  status: String (enum: ['pending', 'completed', 'failed'], default: 'pending'),
  transactionId: String,
  message: String (optional message from donor),
  anonymous: Boolean (default: false),
  createdAt: Date
}
```

## Module 10: Organizations

### Organization Model
```javascript
{
  user: ObjectId (ref: User, required), // linked to organization account
  name: String (required),
  type: String (enum: ['ngo', 'company', 'government', 'educational', 'other']),
  description: String (max 1000 chars),
  website: String,
  email: String,
  phone: String,
  address: String,
  logo: String (image URL),
  documents: [String] (verification documents URLs),
  verified: Boolean (default: false),
  verifiedBy: ObjectId (ref: User), // admin who verified
  verificationDate: Date,
  socialLinks: {
    facebook: String,
    instagram: String,
    vk: String,
    telegram: String
  },
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

## Module 11: Admin / Moderation

### ModerationQueue Model
```javascript
{
  itemType: String (enum: ['news', 'event', 'organization', 'recycling_point']),
  itemId: ObjectId (required),
  status: String (enum: ['pending', 'approved', 'rejected'], default: 'pending'),
  submittedBy: ObjectId (ref: User),
  reviewedBy: ObjectId (ref: User),
  reviewNote: String,
  priority: String (enum: ['low', 'medium', 'high'], default: 'medium'),
  createdAt: Date,
  reviewedAt: Date
}
```

## Indexes for Performance

### Critical Indexes
- User: email, username
- Profile: user, points (desc), level (desc)
- Course: category, level, published
- News: status, publishedAt (desc), author
- Event: date, status, organizer
- RecyclingPoint: coordinates (2dsphere), city, type
- Notification: user, read, createdAt (desc)

## Relationships Summary
- User ←→ Profile (1:1)
- User → News (1:many)
- User → Events (1:many as organizer)
- User → Courses (many:many via Profile.completedCourses)
- User → Achievements (many:many via Profile.achievements)
- Organization → User (1:1)
